### Hugo ###
# Generated files by hugo
/public/
/exampleSite/public/
/resources/_gen/
/exampleSite/resources/_gen/
hugo_stats.json

# The parity harness rebuilds both sides on every run — checked-in copies would
# only ever be stale.
/.parity/base/
/.parity/cand/

# CI symlinks the repository root in here so exampleSite can resolve the theme.
/exampleSite/themes/

# Temporary lock file while building. Unanchored: exampleSite creates its own.
.hugo_build.lock

### Node ###
# The impeccable skill and the parity harness vendor their own dependencies.
node_modules/

.claude/skills/impeccable/
.impeccable/
